    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSF HCM \u0026amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-06T10:52:10+05:30\"\u003eJune 6, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e10:52 am\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://bsf.gov.in/\"\u003eBorder Security Force (BSF)\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e has released the \u003cstrong\u003eExam Date\u003c/strong\u003e on its \u003cstrong\u003eofficial website\u003c/strong\u003e for the \u003cstrong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"256\"\u003erecruitment of Assistant Sub Inspector (ASI) Stenographer and Head Constable (HC) Ministerial 10+2 posts\u003c/strong\u003e. The \u003cstrong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"282\"\u003eBSF exam \u003c/strong\u003ewill be conducted\u003cstrong data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"282\"\u003e on September 2026\u003c/strong\u003e. The last date to submit the application form was \u003cstrong data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"421\"\u003eJuly 08, 2024\u003c/strong\u003e. Candidates can check their \u003cstrong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"467\"\u003eExam Date\u003c/strong\u003e using their \u003cstrong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"540\"\u003eEnrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth\u003c/strong\u003e by logging into the official portal (link provided below).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSF HCM \u0026amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSF ASI Stenographer and Head Constable Examination 2025 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bsf-hcm-asi-steno-2025/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Start Date : \u003cstrong\u003e09 June 2024\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOnline Apply Last Date : \u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e08 July 2024\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eLast Date For Fee Payment : \u003cstrong\u003e08\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e July 2024\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\"\u003eExam Date : September 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card : \u003cspan style=\"color: #ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to confirm from the \u003cstrong\u003eBSF\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eofficial website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor\u003cstrong\u003e General, OBC, EWS \u003c/strong\u003e: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 147.25/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFor\u003cstrong\u003e SC / ST, PWD\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;: \u003cstrong\u003e₹ 00/-\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePayment Mode (Online):\u003c/strong\u003e You can make the payment using the following methods:\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDebit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCredit Card\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eInternet Banking\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eIMPS\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCash Card / Mobile Wallet\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSF ASI Stenographer and Head Constable Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 August 2024\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMinimum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e18 Years\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMaximum Age : \u003cstrong\u003e25 Years\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBSF\u003c/strong\u003e provides age relaxation for the \u003cstrong\u003eASI Steno \u0026amp; HC Ministerial\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eposition as per their regulations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003e1752 Posts\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eBSF ASI Steno \u0026amp; HC Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 54px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 27px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost Name\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo. Of Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 27px;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eASI Stenographer\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e256 Post\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have \u003cstrong\u003epassed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam\u003c/strong\u003e from any recognized board in India and possess \u003cstrong\u003estenography skills\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 20.9046%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eHC Ministerial\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 19.7643%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e1496 Post\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 59.331%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eCandidates must have \u003cstrong\u003epassed the 10+2 (Intermediate) exam\u003c/strong\u003e from any recognized board in India. For more details, refer to the official notification.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #800000;\"\u003eYou May Also Check :\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-assistants-online-form-2024/\"\u003eNIACL Assistants Online Form 2024\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download BSF HCM \u0026amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Visit the \u003cstrong\u003eofficial Border Security Force (BSF)\u003c/strong\u003e recruitment website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Go to the \u003cstrong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"172\"\u003eLatest Notifications\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong data-start=\"176\" data-end=\"191\"\u003eRecruitment\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;section.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Click on the \u003cstrong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"258\"\u003e“BSF HCM \u0026amp; ASI Steno Exam Date 2026”\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;notice link.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;The official exam date notification PDF will open on the screen.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Check the exam date, shift timing, and important instructions carefully.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Download the Exam Date Notice PDF for future reference.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Take a printout of the notice if required.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"154\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Regularly check the official website for admit card updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;BSF ASI Steno \u0026amp; HC Ministerial Recruitment 2025 : \u003c/span\u003eMode Of Selection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"wp-block-list\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eWritten Exam\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eSkill Test\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003ePhysical Measurement Test\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eDocument Verification\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eMedical Examination\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052;\"\u003eJoin Our WhatsApp Channel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VavXmlBEAKWFRHeXwL28\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eFollow Now\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #cc0052;\"\u003eJoin Our Telegram Channel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresultoficial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eFollow Now\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headl